## Vue Router Pattern

```typescript
// router/index.ts — Navigation Guard
router.beforeEach((to, from, next) => {
  const authStore = useAuthStore();
  if (to.meta.requiresAuth && !authStore.isLoggedIn) {
    next({ name: 'login', query: { redirect: to.fullPath } });
  } else {
    next();
  }
});
```

- Use route meta to mark requirements: `meta: { requiresAuth: true, roles: ['admin'] }`
- Never write guard logic directly inside a component

