## Form Validation Pattern

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
const form = reactive({ email: '', password: '' });
const errors = reactive({ email: '', password: '' });

function validate(): boolean {
  errors.email = !form.email.includes('@') ? 'Invalid email' : '';
  errors.password = form.password.length < 8 ? 'Minimum 8 characters' : '';
  return !errors.email && !errors.password;
}

async function handleSubmit() {
  if (!validate()) return;
  // submit logic
}
</script>
```

- Validate before submit — do not submit if there are errors
- Show errors below each field — never use `alert()`

